{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sin &amp; Siege</strong> is a rogue-lite strategy that descends into the abyssal depths, casting you as Hell's Architect and Warden. Your sacred duty: to resurrect and rebuild the infernal circles, multiply demonic legions, and protect the Heart of Darkness from the Forces of Light at any cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834300/extras/5bedd1c4464ec4a590f663937f1e55d0.poster.avif?t=1774536908\" width=960 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834300/extras/5bedd1c4464ec4a590f663937f1e55d0.webm?t=1774536908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834300/extras/5bedd1c4464ec4a590f663937f1e55d0.mp4?t=1774536908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rituals of Construction and War</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each cycle is divided into growth and defense: alongside your devoted demons, you harvest dark souls\u2014the very essence of Hell's power\u2014extract Sins from them to erect structures and spawn warriors of the pit. The work in the Torture Chamber and the Brothel is enticing, but to neglect defense is fatal. Fortify your borders, breed your fighters, master forbidden incantations to repel the onslaught of the righteous and keep the Heart of Darkness inviolate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834300/extras/668008dc110a88f1471dab23e7bf118b.poster.avif?t=1774536908\" width=960 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834300/extras/668008dc110a88f1471dab23e7bf118b.webm?t=1774536908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834300/extras/668008dc110a88f1471dab23e7bf118b.mp4?t=1774536908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Seven Deadly Sins</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of Hell's machinery rests upon seven pillars\u2014the Deadly Sins. Each sin fuels a distinct branch of the infernal economy: Sloth powers farms, manufactories, and quarries; Lust governs propagation. Souls burdened by a particular sin yield corresponding advantages: Gluttons multiply the output of farms, while the Slothful are compelled to toil faster.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834300/extras/c1fed7456d4b9cbe576292709cc791ee.poster.avif?t=1774536908\" width=960 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834300/extras/c1fed7456d4b9cbe576292709cc791ee.webm?t=1774536908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834300/extras/c1fed7456d4b9cbe576292709cc791ee.mp4?t=1774536908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Calling of the Netherworld</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is not merely to withstand the celestial onslaught, but to establish Hell as an immutable, eternal engine of suffering and order, with you as its supreme architect and keeper.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Add Sin &amp; Siege to your Wishlist. We await you in the darkness.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834300/extras/3ff6d06483a67790dbfeed340f7070a8.poster.avif?t=1774536908\" width=960 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834300/extras/3ff6d06483a67790dbfeed340f7070a8.webm?t=1774536908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834300/extras/3ff6d06483a67790dbfeed340f7070a8.mp4?t=1774536908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3834300?t=1774536908","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834300/9d8c9cdc76386e3e1afe4aa4b9313e85b327c6ce/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774536908","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834300/79f02cb015a43d64832947695d6a3ec4856a01ed/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1774536908","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834300/79f02cb015a43d64832947695d6a3ec4856a01ed/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1774536908","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sin &amp; Siege</strong> is a rogue-lite strategy that descends into the abyssal depths, casting you as Hell's Architect and Warden. Your sacred duty: to resurrect and rebuild the infernal circles, multiply demonic legions, and protect the Heart of Darkness from the Forces of Light at any cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834300/extras/5bedd1c4464ec4a590f663937f1e55d0.poster.avif?t=1774536908\" width=960 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.ste